From: Thomas Luebker <53316655+thomas-luebker@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: Big-endian core of PR #27114 (AmigaOS port), applied to v0.5.6
Origin: https://github.com/OpenRCT2/OpenRCT2/pull/27114 (head a5dbca57c5be, closed unmerged)

The byte-order parts of https://github.com/OpenRCT2/OpenRCT2/pull/27114
(head a5dbca57c5be, closed unmerged): little-endian IStream scalars and
self-converting on-disk structs, Orca/park stream integers, S6/S4
in-place swaps, host-aware ByteSwapBE, checksums over LE words, union
byte order. Conflicts with v0.5.6 resolved (DataSerialiserTraits MapRange,
SawyerCoding DetectFileType moved to RCT1File, detectRCT1Version).

